<title>GERMANY: German air cargo up 5.6pct Jan-Nov 1996.</title>
<headline>German air cargo up 5.6pct Jan-Nov 1996.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total air cargo flown to and from Germany rose 5.6 percent to 1,809,284 tonnes over the first eleven months of 1996, the monthly traffic report of the German airports association (ADV) said.</p>
<p>The following table shows total,flown and trucked air cargo volumes in tonnes at international German airports January-November 1996 with percentage changes from a year ago.</p>
<p> AIRPORT	  FLOWN	 TRUCKED    TOTAL    PCT</p>
<p>								CHANGE</p>
<p> Berlin (total)    29,725    5,332     35,057   up   11.0</p>
<p> - Tegel	     17,261    5,004     22,265   up   10.4</p>
<p> - Tempelhof	    304	  0	  304   down 49.0</p>
<p> - Schoenefeld     12,160	328     12,488   up   15.2</p>
<p> Bremen		 2,400   22,230     24,630   up   16.8</p>
<p> Dresden		1,336    2,632	3,968   up   15.3</p>
<p> Duesseldorf	 53,001	n/a	  n/a	   n/a</p>
<p> Frankfurt	1,246,237	n/a	  n/a	   n/a</p>
<p> Hamburg	     33,415	n/a	  n/a	   n/a</p>
<p> Hannover	    10,270	n/a	  n/a	   n/a</p>
<p> Cologne	    295,428   30,523    325,951	   n/a</p>
<p> Leipzig/Halle	2,832    1,310	4,142	   n/a</p>
<p> Munich		74,440	n/a	  n/a	   n/a</p>
<p> Muenster		 651   11,466     12,117	   n/a</p>
<p> Nuremberg	   41,516   28,038     69,554   up    7.7</p>
<p> Saarbruecken	   729    1,495	2,224   up    3.2</p>
<p> Stuttgart	   17,304   50,084     67,388   up    6.3</p>
<p> TOTAL	    1,809,284	n/a	n/a	     n/a</p>
<p>*Notes: No overall air cargo total is given as several large airports with known large trucking volumes including Frankfurt, Munich and Duesseldorf do not release trucking figures.</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
